      "page": 438,
      "ruku": 379,
      "hizbQuarter": 175,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3693,
      "text": "They will enter Gardens of Eternity; they will be adorned therein with bracelets of gold and pearls, and their garments will be of silk.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 35,
        "name": "سُورَةُ فَاطِرٍ",
        "englishName": "Faatir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Originator",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 33,
      "juz": 22,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 438,
      "ruku": 379,
      "hizbQuarter": 175,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3694,
      "text": "And they will say, “All praise be to Allah Who has taken away from us all sorrow. Indeed, our Lord is All-Forgiving, Most Appreciative,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 35,
        "name": "سُورَةُ فَاطِرٍ",
        "englishName": "Faatir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Originator",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 34,
      "juz": 22,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 438,
      "ruku": 379,
      "hizbQuarter": 175,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3695,
      "text": "He Who has caused us to settle – out of His grace – in the everlasting home, wherein no weariness or fatigue will touch us.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 35,
        "name": "سُورَةُ فَاطِرٍ",
        "englishName": "Faatir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Originator",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 35,
      "juz": 22,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 438,
      "ruku": 379,
      "hizbQuarter": 175,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3696,
      "text": "As for those who disbelieve, there will be the Fire of Hell; neither will they be sentenced to death, so that they may die, nor will its punishment be lightened for them. This is how We recompense every disbeliever.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 35,
        "name": "سُورَةُ فَاطِرٍ",
        "englishName": "Faatir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Originator",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 36,
      "juz": 22,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 438,
      "ruku": 379,
      "hizbQuarter": 175,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3697,
      "text": "They will be screaming therein, “Our Lord, take us out; we will do righteous deeds, unlike what we used to do.” [They will be told], “Did We not give you long enough lives to take heed for anyone who wished to take heed? And the warner did come to you. So taste! The wrongdoers will have no helper.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 35,
        "name": "سُورَةُ فَاطِرٍ",
        "englishName": "Faatir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Originator",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 37,
      "juz": 22,
      "manzil": 5,
